PURPOSE of /kernel/audio_tests/functional/audio_jack_sanity_test
Description: Test that checks if the soundcards detected show all of the expected audio jacks.
Author: Ken Benoit <kbenoit@redhat.com>
Test steps:
 * Read in the audio jack definition file
 * Check for any unsupported soundcards present on the work node
 * Check that only expected audio jack names are present
